		{"id":"3da9c40e5b693290","type":"text","text":"Employee resets password.\nRedirected to multistep onboarding form","x":-20,"y":517,"width":250,"height":103},
		{"id":"3faf24069e289103","type":"text","text":"#### **Step 1** - Personal Information\n\n**Section 1 - Personal Information**\n\nFather's Name*\nPersonal Email*\nPhone No*\nGender\nHeight \nWeight\n\nMartial Status\n> if married\nMarriage Date\nSpouse Name\n\nCountry of Origin\nNationality*\nPhysically Challenged\n>if yes\nDisability Type\n\nReligion\n\n**Section 2 - Address**\nPermanent Address* \nCurrent Address (Same as above checkbox)*\n\n**Section 3 - Qualifications**\nQualification\nFrom Year - To Year\nInstitue\nGrade\n\nCan be added multiple like LinkedIn\n\n","x":400,"y":517,"width":381,"height":863},
		{"id":"746fff773a67a527","type":"text","text":"**Add new employee (Admin)**\n\nEmployee Name\nEmployee Number\nDate of Joining\nLocation\nEmail ID\n\nAdding this info sends invite email to the employee with expiry date of 7 days.","x":-500,"y":517,"width":366,"height":267},
		{"id":"64addbd7ad8da82a","type":"file","file":"Screenshot 2026-06-02 at 6.24.40 PM (2).png","x":401,"y":1460,"width":380,"height":214},
