		{"id":"424da69da7bae832","type":"file","file":"Screenshot 2026-06-02 at 6.52.19 PM.png","x":910,"y":949,"width":400,"height":188},
		{"id":"5a70c41baaac8d06","type":"text","text":"### Step 3 - Bank & Statutory Details\n\n**Bank account details**\n\nAccount Number\nConfirm Bank Account Number\nIFSC Code\nPayee Name\nAccount Type\n\n**PF Account details**\n\nPF Account Number\nUAN\n\n**Permanent Account Number (PAN)**\nPAN Number\nName in PAN\n\n**Aadhaar**\nAadhar Number\nName in Aadhaar\n\n**Passport**\nPassport Number\nName in Passport\nExpiry Date\n\n\n\n\n","x":1480,"y":517,"width":380,"height":663},
		{"id":"10a03f9873e6a9c1","type":"text","text":"### Step 4 - Family & Nominee Details\n\n**Family Details**\nName \nRelationship\nDOB\nGender\n\nCan be added multiple like LinkedIn\n\n**Nominee Details**\nName\nRelationship\n\n\n\n\n","x":1980,"y":517,"width":380,"height":363},
		{"id":"03ef278d4df1df04","type":"text","text":"### Step 5 - Attachments\n\nAddress Proof\nQualification (This will be dynamic based on which qualifications are added)\nAadhar Card\nPan Card\nBank Details\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","x":2480,"y":517,"width":380,"height":223},
